--- !u!114 &1394413374
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1394413372}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f73a0bcbd8054f441bbe4363b2d0b8cb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speaker: You
    text: 'Hey Dave, what happened to your shell? '
  - speaker: Turtle Dave
    text: I was SO hungry....
  - speaker: You
    text: 'You ate your own shell? Dave, that''s really bad. '
  - speaker: Turtle Dave
    text: 'Relax I''ll grow a new one in no time. '
  - speaker: You
    text: 'I don''t think that''s how it works. '
  - speaker: Turle Dave
    text: 'With the power of milk it is.  That vitamin D makes my bones grow. Help
      me get some milk please, or else I''ll die. '
  - speaker: You
    text: 'How the fuck am I supposed to get milk from?? We''re in the ocean.  '
  - speaker: Turte Dave
    text: 'Trust me bro. Go South, you''ll find milk on the way. And hurry, I can
      feel my skin dissolving. I''ve already lost my feet, as you probably noticed.  '
  question: Swim downwards to look for milk?
  option1Text: Swim downwards
  option2Text: Don't
